{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32142","headline":"故城曲 · 温庭筠","name":"故城曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠沙堤烟，堤西雉子斑。\n雉声何角角，麦秀桑阴闲。\n游丝荡平绿，明灭时相续。\n白马金络头，东风故城曲。\n故城殷贵嫔，曾占未来春。\n自从香骨化，飞作马蹄尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}